8712b254bd53", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:dawnbreaker_fire_wreath:terrain_walk:shard", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_luminosity", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·熠熠生辉", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "After a number of attacks, Dawnbreaker powers up, charging her next attack with a critical hit that heals all allied heroes within %heal_radius% units around her for a portion of attack damage dealt. Creeps and neutral enemies provide less healing. Allies are healed for %allied_healing_pct%%% of the amount.", "notes_loc": ["Luminosity Heal is increased by sources of Health Restoration Amplification.", "Break disables the gaining of new stacks."], "scepter_loc": "Dawnbreaker gets 2 Luminosity attacks every time she powers up.", "facets_loc": ["Whenever Dawnbreaker hits a target with a powered up Luminosity, she decreases the cooldowns of all of her abilities."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "After a number of attacks, Dawnbreaker powers up, charging her next attack with a critical hit that heals all allied heroes within %heal_radius% units around her for a portion of attack damage dealt. Creeps and neutral enemies provide less healing. Allies are healed for %allied_healing_pct%%% of the amount.", "notes_loc": ["Luminosity Heal is increased by sources of Health Restoration Amplification.", "Break disables the gaining of new stacks."], "scepter_loc": "Dawnbreaker gets 2 Luminosity attacks every time she powers up.", "facets_loc": ["Whenever Dawnbreaker hits a target with a powered up Luminosity, she decreases the cooldowns of all of her abilities."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "8246c7bf594153e8e277", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:dawnbreaker_luminosity:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "aaac3bd57495e74995f8", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "46695ac7b399da518632", "mechanism": "critical", "mechanism_zh": "暴击", "definition": "攻击造成额外倍数伤害；有概率触发或强化下一次攻击都算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "4dd00b1efdc13bf7a6e7", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dazzle_innate_weave", "name_zh": "戴泽·编织", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Dazzle's abilities apply Weave to both allies and enemies they affect, increasing allied armor and reducing enemy armor. Multiple instances of this effect stack.", "shard_loc": "Applying Weave to an ally heals them for %ally_heal% per stack of Weave.", "facets_loc": ["Weave applies %ally_multiplier%x stacks to allies. Weave amplifies incoming heals from Dazzle by %heal_amplification_pct%%% per stack.", "Weave applies %enemy_multiplier%x stacks to enemies."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Dazzle's abilities apply Weave to both allies and enemies they affect, increasing allied armor and reducing enemy armor. Multiple instances of this effect stack.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the applying of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."], "shard_loc": "Applying a stack of Weave heals an ally for %ally_heal% per stack of Weave.", "facets_loc": ["Weave applies %ally_multiplier%x stacks to allies. Weave amplifies incoming heals from Dazzle by %heal_amplification_pct%%% per stack.", "Weave applies %enemy_multiplier%x stacks to enemies."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "ability_has_shard", "old": true, "new": false}, {"field": "ally_heal", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": [60]}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "640857e0251a0c6a76af", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a2ab422aa2bd8ff700c2", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "799443581e85b1792948", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dazzle_nothl_projection", "name_zh": "戴泽·虚无投影", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Dazzle departs his body, traveling through the Nothl Realm as an invulnerable spirit that can cast spells, attack, and use items, leaving his body behind in the world with a visible tether. While active, Dazzle's basic abilities are empowered: Poison Touch hexes enemies, Shallow Grave heals upon expiration, and Shadow Wave has a shorter cooldown. The effect can be ended early, and Dazzle returns to the body at the end.", "notes_loc": ["When Dazzle's spirit is further than %leash_start% units from the body, the tether will begin to pull him back. The strength of the pull increases with distance.", "Dazzle's Soul cannot attack buildings."], "shard_loc": "Nothl Projection can be cast while Dazzle is disabled. Increases healing done while in the Nothl Realm."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Dazzle departs his body, traveling through the Nothl Realm as an invulnerable spirit that can cast spells, attack, and use items, leaving his body behind in the world with a visible tether. While active, Dazzle's basic abilities are empowered: Poison Touch hexes enemies, Shallow Grave heals upon expiration, and Shadow Wave has reduced cooldown. The effect can be ended early, and Dazzle returns to the body at the end.", "notes_loc": ["When Dazzle's spirit is further than %leash_start% units from the body, the tether will begin to pull him back. The strength of the pull increases with distance.", "Dazzle's Soul cannot attack buildings."], "shard_loc": "Increases Nothl Projection's cast range by %shard_cast_range_bonus% and leash range by %shard_leash_range_bonus%."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "ability_has_shard", "old": false, "new": true}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [450], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [450], "scepter": null, "shard": [250]}}, {"field": "initial_travel_speed", "old": {"base": [1200], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1700], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "leash_start", "old": {"base": [1600], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1600], "scepter": null, "shard": [500]}}, {"field": "min_duration", "old": {"base": [5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "shard_cast_range_bonus", "old": null, "new": {"base": [250], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "shard_leash_range_bonus", "old": null, "new": {"base": [500], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "soul_return_time", "old": {"base": [0.75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "bb942914e861a482e338", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "e141a2d57a89b0e6b4bf", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "50ea53ff6b4217ca569e", "mechanism": "hex", "mechanism_zh": "妖术", "definition": "把目标变成无害小动物，期间无法攻击、施法和使用物品", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "44f94dfd962227795472", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dazzle_poison_touch", "name_zh": "戴泽·剧毒之触", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Releases a cone of poison that strikes multiple enemy units. Deals damage over time and slows the targets. Anytime the targets get attacked by Dazzle, the debuff duration is refreshed and slow is increased.", "notes_loc": ["The damage is not reduced by damage block abilities."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Releases a cone of poison that strikes multiple enemy units. Deals damage over time and slows the targets. Anytime the targets get attacked by Dazzle, the debuff duration is refreshed and slow is increased.", "notes_loc": ["The damage is not reduced by damage block abilities."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "attack_range_bonus", "old": {"base": [], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "undispellable", "old": null, "new": {"base": [], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "67b4a5cf1cd9278e4c90", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "929c2e3ee8e05365a8ab", "mechanism": "damage_block", "mechanism_zh": "护盾/伤害吸收/减伤", "definition": "吸收一定伤害、按比例减少受到的伤害，或把受到的伤害延迟结算（如统帅朗姆酒、虚妄之诺）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "790f2c7a7c349c8ab0d6", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "9db63c151aaa34e1222b", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "f57c4d5bbf1b25e7fcda", "mechanism": "spell_block", "mechanism_zh": "格挡指向技能", "definition": "使指向自身或队友的技能失效", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "b9b74a5ce572e08f5dd2", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dazzle_shadow_wave", "name_zh": "戴泽·暗影波", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Sends out a bolt of power that arcs between allies, healing them while damaging any enemy units standing nearby. Dazzle is always healed by Shadow Wave.", "notes_loc": ["Prioritizes allied heroes over creeps.", "If enemies are near multiple allied units affected by Shadow Wave, they will take multiple instances of damage."], "scepter_loc": "Shadow Wave can now target and bounce between enemies in addition to allies. When bouncing to an enemy, they will take damage and heal nearby allies equal to %scepter_heal_pct%%% of the normal healing and damage values. Dazzle will also perform an attack against any enemy that Shadow Wave bounces to."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Sends out a bolt of power that arcs between allies, healing them while damaging any enemy units standing nearby. Dazzle is always healed by Shadow Wave.", "notes_loc": ["Prioritizes allied heroes over creeps.", "If enemies are near multiple allied units affected by Shadow Wave, they will take multiple instances of damage."], "scepter_loc": "Shadow Wave can now target and bounce between enemies in addition to allies. When bouncing to an enemy, they will take damage and heal nearby allies equal to %scepter_heal_pct%%% of the normal healing and damage values. Dazzle will also perform an attack against any enemy that Shadow Wave bounces to."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "1d5c11a61b45934cb642", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b44683a66be3b0b0e923", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "771f615b7fc5c8481b50", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d27deb5cc39247959220", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dazzle_shallow_grave", "name_zh": "戴泽·薄葬", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "An ally blessed with Shallow Grave, no matter how close to death, cannot die while under its protection. Healing on that ally is also amplified for the duration based on the hero's HP.", "notes_loc": ["HP cannot go below 1 while under the effects of Shallow Grave, but Axe's Culling Blade will still kill the hero."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "An ally blessed with Shallow Grave, no matter how close to death, cannot die while under its protection. Healing on that ally is also amplified for the duration based on the hero's HP.", "notes_loc": ["HP cannot go below 1 while under the effects of Shallow Grave, but Axe's Culling Blade will still kill the hero."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "c15b4af503b114a7b858", "mechanism": "death_prevention", "mechanism_zh": "免死", "definition": "在一段时间内不会被打死（如薄葬、回光返照）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "760e3f09453a6fb8cb0b", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "3d1c5f16614b7cb8b255", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "death_prophet_carrion_swarm", "name_zh": "死亡先知·地穴虫群", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Sends a swarm of winged beasts to savage enemy units in front of Death Prophet.", "notes_loc": ["Can hit units up to 1110 range away.", "Does not trigger spell block or 