g_damage_pct%%% damage to buildings."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "attack_damage_pct", "old": null, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "building_damage_pct", "old": null, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "cooldown_reduction_pct", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "current_damage_tooltip", "old": null, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "give_up_distance", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1200], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "heal_percent", "old": null, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "max_distance", "old": null, "new": {"base": [2000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "movement_speed_pct", "old": {"base": [0.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "radius", "old": null, "new": {"base": [700], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "spirit_duration", "old": null, "new": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "spirit_speed", "old": null, "new": {"base": [650], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "spirits", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "b1dc4f895ff35556557f", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b43f1a7ebb2cd37c4183", "mechanism": "cooldown_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减冷却", "definition": "减少别的技能或物品的冷却；只减这个技能自身的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b889c9f2d3d0a3927fe8", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "fe8476a622f929db996e", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "desolator", "name_zh": "黯灭", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Corruption Your attacks reduce the target's armor by %corruption_armor% for %corruption_duration% seconds. Passive: Soul Stealer Desolator gains +%bonus_damage_per_kill% damage every time an enemy hero dies while affected by Corruption, to a maximum of %max_damage%.", "notes_loc": ["Armor reduction works on buildings."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Corruption Your attacks reduce the target's armor by %corruption_armor% for %corruption_duration% seconds. Passive: Soul Stealer Desolator gains +%bonus_damage_per_kill% damage every time an enemy hero dies while affected by Corruption, to a maximum of %max_damage%.", "notes_loc": ["Armor reduction works on buildings."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "7db00b701589c46ae98f", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:desolator:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "devastator", "name_zh": "圣斧", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Witch Blade Causes your next attack to have true strike, apply a poison for %slow_duration% seconds, slowing by %slow%%% and dealing %int_damage_multiplier%x your intelligence as damage every second. Passive: Magic Corruption Your attacks reduce the enemy's Magic resistance by %active_mres_reduction%%% for %passive_cooldown% seconds."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Witch Blade Causes your next attack to apply a poison for %slow_duration% seconds, slowing by %slow%%% and dealing %int_damage_multiplier%x your intelligence as damage every second. This attack has True Strike and can affect buildings. Deals %building_effectiveness_pct%%% damage to buildings. Passive: Magic Corruption Your attacks reduce the enemy's Magic resistance by %active_mres_reduction%%% for %reduction_duration% seconds.", "notes_loc": ["Illusions do not apply Witch Blade, but can apply Magic Corruption"]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "active_mres_reduction", "old": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "building_effectiveness_pct", "old": null, "new": {"base": [40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "int_damage_multiplier", "old": {"base": [0.75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0.85], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "reduction_duration", "old": null, "new": {"base": [4], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:devastator:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "5a1b1c0738b742bc0bbd", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d8a05d30a92fce6a3fca", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3fbd91fe440c4bf01d7b", "mechanism": "pierce_evasion", "mechanism_zh": "克敌机先", "definition": "攻击无视闪避（必中）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "219f1ffa6db0e8a83dfa", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "diffusal_blade", "name_zh": "净魂之刃", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Inhibit Targets an enemy, slowing it for %purge_slow_duration% seconds. Passive: Manabreak Each attack burns %feedback_mana_burn% mana from the t